            %a{:href => "http://www.andrew.cmu.edu/course/80-413-713/notes/chap10.pdf"} Chapter 10
            of
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Steve+Awodey"}> Steve Awodey
              ,
